{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Landed: Gerrit 3456 merged as 5cde271a8ee0befc319499bcc47699b4c8012bf0 (LLM-Review +1; Verified +1 on run 44528682304 after a recheck: the first run's only failure was `apt-get install bubblewrap` failing with \"Unable to locate package\" before any repository code ran). Local make verify passed on bd4b45f5330: 21,453 passed plus 226 integration. The first verify caught `tests/unit/test_completion_sidecar_material_balding.py::test_completion_gate_error_emit_enriches_only_completion_records`, which emitted for a made-up id against a stubbed tracker; it now stubs the resolver, because refusing unknown ids is the intended behaviour. Root cause: `emit_gate_error` passed the caller's raw id to `append_event`, which writes to whatever directory it is named. Portability: no subprocess, fd, path, encoding or permission change, so no Windows sweep was dispatched."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795095066869845912,"uuid":"0bbbb900-05bf-4ef4-932a-d93d93a5d78e"}